# Feral Encounter: "At the beginning of the next combat phase this turn". Cast in Bot1's second main phase there is no combat phase
# left this turn, so the delayed ability never triggers (the ruling): it ends with the turn, and Bot2's combat on turn 4 asks nobody
# for targets and deals no damage. The Elves exiled are cast this turn all the same, from the second main phase.

